	(text "ESP32-S31 VISION PRO rev C  -  SHEET 1/4: POWER   (battery, protection, BQ24075 power path, TMR3102 magnetic latch, chord power-on, TPS63802 always-on 3V3, load switches, camera LDOs)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "99953ed2-93eb-5d1f-aaa1-c380659693fd")
	)
	(text "J1 cell (JST-PH, pin 1 = +, pin 2 = -). Q1 AO3401A high-side reverse-polarity guard. U18 BQ29700 + Q3 FS8205A (back-to-back CHG/DSG N-FETs in the cell's negative lead):\nover-charge 4.275 V, over-discharge 2.8 V, over-current / short-circuit sensed on V- through R48 2.2k (PROT_VM). VBAT_PROT = protected cell +.\nR_MEAS_BAT (0805 0R): remove and insert a multimeter / Nordic PPK2 in series to measure the exact battery charge or discharge current. VBAT (after it) feeds U1 BAT, U19 and TP3.\nU1 BQ24075 (rev C): EN2 = VBUS via R50 10k, EN1 = GND -> ILIM resistor mode (no VIN-DPM in this mode); /CE, SYSOFF = GND. Design ceiling: 1S LiPo <= 3000 mAh (placeholder).\nR3 887R 0.1% ISET -> ICHG = 890 / 887 = 1.00 A (0.33 C at 3000 mAh), pre-charge 99 mA, termination 100 mA. R2 1.13k ILIM -> 1610 / 1.13k = 1.42 A. R49 68k TMR -> 9.1 h fast-charge timer (54 min pre-charge). TH1 10k NTC on TS. /CHG -> CHG_STAT (IO18), /PGOOD -> CHG_PGOOD (IO19), R4/R5 100k to +3V3_SYS.\nVSYS (BQ24075 OUT) = VBAT when on battery, up to 5.5 V (VOUT(REG)) on USB: within the TPS63802 (5.5 V) and TMR3102 (1.8-5.5 V) ratings.\nU3 TMR3102SO (always on, VDD = VSYS, 3.4 uA, push-pull): bistable latch, one magnet pole -> TMR_OUT high (board ON), the opposite pole -> low (OFF). USB charging works while OFF.\nChord power-on (rev C): SW_L and SW_R (SPST 6x6) in series VSYS -> WAKE_MID -> WAKE. EN_TPS = TMR_OUT | WAKE | HOLD through BAT54WS Schottkys, R_EN_PD 100k. Firmware checks\nboth keys for 2 s (SENSE_L IO0, SENSE_R IO4, 47k/100k dividers) and drives HOLD (IO12); TMR_SENSE (IO13) = TMR_OUT x 1M/1.47M. Dividers keep the pins <= 3.6 V up to VSYS 5.29 V.\nU2 TPS63802 (EN = EN_TPS): VOUT = 0.5 V x (1 + 56k/10k) = 3.30 V (R6 56k, R7 10k, both 1%; was 220k/39k, two Extended lines) on +3V3_REG (C6/C7 bulk). R_MEAS_3V3 (0603 0R) sits after the bulk caps, before the load split: open it to measure total deep-sleep current.\n+3V3_SYS (always-on domain) feeds only: ESP32-S31 module, J_RADAR, fuel-gauge I2C pull-ups (U19 itself senses and is powered from VBAT: its VDD pin is its cell-sense input),\ntamper pull-up R44 - plus the SHT40 that shares the always-on I2C bus (a powered-down sensor would clamp SDA/SCL), the strap pull-ups and the load-switch inputs.\nU4 +3V3_SD, U5 +3V3_CAM, U10 FAN_VCC: TPS22919 (2 nA off, QOD tied to OUT), ON pulled down by R10/R11/R52 100k -> every switched rail is OFF in reset and deep sleep.\nU6 2.8 V and U7 1.5 V camera LDOs: fed and enabled by +3V3_CAM (R11 = EN_CAM pull-down)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 57.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e06b014c-e2cb-5e93-b6ab-533fb18f3ae1")
	)
